    {
      "path": "capa.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "capa.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    :root {\n      --bg-page: #0B1120;\n      --bg-surface: #131B2F;\n      --text-main: #F8FAFC;\n      --text-muted: #94A3B8;\n      --accent-cyan: #06B6D4;\n      --font-display: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n      --font-code: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    }\n    .slide-container {\n      width: 1280px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      background: var(--bg-page);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 60px 80px;\n      position: relative;\n      font-family: var(--font-display);\n    }\n    .content {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n      padding-bottom: 60px;\n    }\n    .title-line {\n      width: 120px;\n      height: 4px;\n      background: var(--accent-cyan);\n      margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 64px;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      max-width: 900px;\n    }\n    p.summary {\n      margin-top: 24px;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      max-width: 700px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 40px;\n      left: 80px;\n      right: 80px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n    .brand-mono { font-family: var(--font-code); color: var(--accent-cyan); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"></div>\n      <h1>Supabase Auth + Storage<br>no App Android SWE</h1>\n      <p class=\"summary\">Como transformar o acesso existente em uma integração reutilizável, segura e observável entre Web e Mobile.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <span>MWC / UMS · Supabase integration</span>\n      <span class=\"brand-mono\">SLIDE 01</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "ponto_partida.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "ponto_partida.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    :root {\n      --bg-page: #0B1120;\n      --bg-surface: #131B2F;\n      --text-main: #F8FAFC;\n      --text-muted: #94A3B8;\n      --border-subtle: #1E293B;\n      --accent-cyan: #06B6D4;\n      --font-display: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n      --font-code: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    }\n    .slide-container {\n      width: 1280px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      background: var(--bg-page);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 40px 60px;\n      font-family: var(--font-display);\n    }\n    .header { margin-bottom: 40px; }\n    .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 14px; color: var(--accent-cyan); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    h2 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; flex: 1; padding-top: 20px; }\n    .card { background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n    .card-title { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 16px; color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: 12px; }\n    ul { list-style: none; }\n    li { margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; }\n    li::before { content: '→'; margin-right: 12px; color: var(--accent-cyan); flex-shrink: 0; }\n    .code-inline { font-family: var(--font-code); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 16px; }\n    .footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Análise de Baseline</div>\n      <h2>O que já existe — e o que foi confirmado</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Infraestrutura Supabase</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Projeto <span class=\"code-inline\">ufylccbdjfzydbwhpmpp</span> ativo e saudável.</li>\n          <li>Tabelas Blockchain <span class=\"code-inline\">mw_*</span> com RLS <span class=\"code-inline\">authenticated</span>.</li>\n          <li>Bucket <span class=\"code-inline\">sofia_storage_user</span> pronto para persistência.</li>\n          <li>Chave Pública confirmada via <span class=\"code-inline\">clients_read</span> (200 OK).</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Evidências AppAndroidSWE-Start</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Dependência do <span class=\"code-inline\">@supabase/supabase-js</span> já integrada.</li>\n          <li>Fluxo de login manual baseado na tabela <span class=\"code-inline\">clients</span>.</li>\n          <li>Gestão de sessão persistente no lado do cliente.</li>\n          <li>Mecanismo de <span class=\"code-inline\">saveUserConfig</span> em LocalStorage.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <span>MWC / UMS · Supabase integration</span>\n      <span style=\"font-family: var(--font-code);\">SLIDE 02</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "arquitetura_alvo.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "arquitetura_alvo.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    :root {\n      --bg-page: #0B1120;\n      --bg-surface: #131B2F;\n      --text-main: #F8FAFC;\n      --text-muted: #94A3B8;\n      --border-subtle: #1E293B;\n      --accent-cyan: #06B6D4;\n      --accent-green: #10B981;\n      --accent-purple: #A855F7;\n      --font-display: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n      --font-code: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    }\n    .slide-container {\n      width: 1280px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      background: var(--bg-page);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 40px 60px;\n      font-family: var(--font-display);\n    }\n    .header { margin-bottom: 30px; }\n    .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 14px; color: var(--accent-purple); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    h2 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .diagram-zone { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; }\n    .box { background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; min-width: 240px; position: relative; }\n    .box-title { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; }\n    .box-main { font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; }\n    .arrow { position: absolute; background: var(--border-subtle); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 20px; }\n    .arrow-h { height: 2px; }\n    .arrow-v { width: 2px; }\n    .android-client { border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-cyan); }\n    .supabase-auth { border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-cyan); top: -100px; }\n    .postgres-rls { border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-purple); }\n    .storage-sofia { border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-green); bottom: -100px; }\n    .flow-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }\n    .footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Arquitetura Estrutural</div>\n      <h2>Arquitetura alvo: uma sessão, dois destinos</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-zone\">\n      <!-- Android Client -->\n      <div class=\"box android-client\" style=\"left: -300px;\">\n        <span class=\"box-title\">Frontend</span>\n        <span class=\"box-main\">Android Client<br>(React / Expo)</span>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Central Arrows -->\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: -100px; top: -20px; width: 100px; height: 40px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-subtle); border-left: 2px solid var(--border-subtle);\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: -100px; bottom: -20px; width: 100px; height: 40px; border-top: 2px solid var(--border-subtle); border-left: 2px solid var(--border-subtle);\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: -100px; width: 100px; height: 2px; background: var(--border-subtle);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Auth -->\n      <div class=\"box supabase-auth\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 120px;\">\n        <span class=\"box-title\" style=\"color: var(--accent-cyan)\">Identity</span>\n        <span class=\"box-main\">Supabase Auth<br>(Session Persistence)</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Postgres -->\n      <div class=\"box postgres-rls\">\n        <span class=\"box-title\" style=\"color: var(--accent-purple)\">Database</span>\n        <span class=\"box-main\">Postgres + RLS<br>(Tabelas mw_*)</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Storage -->\n      <div class=\"box storage-sofia\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 120px;\">\n        <span class=\"box-title\" style=\"color: var(--accent-green)\">Object Store</span>\n        <span class=\"box-main\">sofia_storage_user<br>(JSON Snapshots)</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- RLS Check Arrows -->\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 200px; top: 140px; width: 50px; height: 180px; border-top: 2px dashed var(--accent-purple); border-right: 2px dashed var(--accent-purple); border-radius: 0 10px 0 0;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 200px; bottom: 140px; width: 50px; height: 180px; border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--accent-purple); border-right: 2px dashed var(--accent-purple); border-radius: 0 0 10px 0;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 250px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--accent-purple); font-size: 14px; font-family: var(--font-code);\">RLS GATE</div>\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <span>MWC / UMS · Supabase integration</span>\n      <span style=\"font-family: var(--font-code);\">SLIDE 03</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "fluxo_auth.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "fluxo_auth.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    :root {\n      --bg-page: #0B1120;\n      --bg-surface: #131B2F;\n      --text-main: #F8FAFC;\n      --text-muted: #94A3B8;\n      --border-subtle: #1E293B;\n      --accent-cyan: #06B6D4;\n      --font-display: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n      --font-code: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    }\n    .slide-container {\n      width: 1280px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      background: var(--bg-page);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 40px 60px;\n      font-family: var(--font-display);\n    }\n    .header { margin-bottom: 30px; }\n    .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 14px; color: var(--accent-cyan); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    h2 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .flow { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; flex: 1; justify-content: center; }\n    .step { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px; position: relative; }\n    .step:not(:last-child)::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 24px; top: 50px; bottom: -20px; width: 2px; background: var(--border-subtle); }\n    .number { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid var(--accent-cyan); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--font-code); font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-cyan); background: var(--bg-page); z-index: 1; flex-shrink: 0; }\n    .step-content { background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 30px; flex: 1; }\n    .step-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    .step-desc { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }\n    .code { font-family: var(--font-code); color: var(--accent-cyan); font-size: 14px; }\n    .footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Módulo de Identidade</div>\n      <h2>Fluxo de autenticação recomendado</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow\">\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"number\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"step-content\">\n          <div class=\"step-title\">Lookup de Usuário</div>\n          <div class=\"step-desc\">Consulta na tabela <span class=\"code\">clients</span> por e-mail ou username para resolver o e-mail real do Supabase Auth.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"number\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"step-content\">\n          <div class=\"step-title\">Handshake de Credenciais</div>\n          <div class=\"step-desc\">Chamada ao <span class=\"code\">auth.signInWithPassword</span>. A sessão é persistida automaticamente pelo SDK.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"number\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"step-content\">\n          <div class=\"step-title\">Recuperação de Config</div>\n          <div class=\"step-desc\">Carregamento do <span class=\"code\">USER_CONFIG</span> (local) baseado no <span class=\"code\">user.id</span> retornado pela sessão.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"number\">04</div>\n        <div class=\"step-content\">\n          <div class=\"step-title\">Sincronização Ativa</div>\n          <div class=\"step-desc\">Disparo imediato do <span class=\"code\">flush()</span> da fila de persistência para processar itens pendentes.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <span>MWC / UMS · Supabase integration</span>\n      <span style=\"font-family: var(--font-code);\">SLIDE 04</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "fluxo_storage.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "fluxo_storage.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    :root {\n      --bg-page: #0B1120;\n      --bg-surface: #131B2F;\n      --text-main: #F8FAFC;\n      --text-muted: #94A3B8;\n      --border-subtle: #1E293B;\n      --accent-green: #10B981;\n      --font-display: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n      --font-code: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    }\n    .slide-container {\n      width: 1280px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      background: var(--bg-page);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 40px 60px;\n      font-family: var(--font-display);\n    }\n    .header { margin-bottom: 30px; }\n    .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 14px; color: var(--accent-green); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    h2 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .content-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; flex: 1; }\n    .box { background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; }\n    .box-title { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 15px; color: var(--accent-green); margin-bottom: 20px; }\n    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }\n    th { text-align: left; font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }\n    td { padding: 16px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); font-size: 15px; }\n    .path { font-family: var(--font-code); color: var(--accent-green); font-size: 14px; }\n    .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); color: var(--accent-green); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n    .footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Object Persistence</div>\n      <h2>Storage: snapshots e caminhos determinísticos</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-grid\">\n      <div class=\"box\">\n        <div class=\"box-title\">Estrutura no Bucket <span style=\"color: var(--text-main)\">sofia_storage_user</span></div>\n        <table>\n          <thead><tr><th>Entidade</th><th>Caminho (Path)</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>Snapshots</td><td class=\"path\">mwc-ums/{chain_id}/snapshots/{block}.json</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Histórico</td><td class=\"path\">mwc-ums/{chain_id}/history/full_report.csv</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Meta</td><td class=\"path\">mwc-ums/{chain_id}/metadata.json</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"box\">\n        <div class=\"box-title\">Regras de Upload</div>\n        <div class=\"tag\">IDEMPOTÊNCIA</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;\">Uso obrigatório de <span class=\"path\">upsert: true</span> para garantir que re-enviar o mesmo bloco não gere erros nem arquivos duplicados.</p>\n        <div class=\"tag\">METADADOS</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-muted);\">Inclusão de <span class=\"path\">contentType: 'application/json'</span> e <span class=\"path\">cacheControl</span> de 1 hora para otimizar leituras repetidas do mesmo bloco.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <span>MWC / UMS · Supabase integration</span>\n      <span style=\"font-family: var(--font-code);\">SLIDE 05</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "organizacao_codigo.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "organizacao_codigo.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    :root {\n      --bg-page: #0B1120;\n      --bg-surface: #131B2F;\n      --text-main: #F8FAFC;\n      --text-muted: #94A3B8;\n      --border-subtle: #1E293B;\n      --accent-cyan: #06B6D4;\n      --font-display: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n      --font-code: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    }\n    .slide-container {\n      width: 1280px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      background: var(--bg-page);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 40px 60px;\n      font-family: var(--font-display);\n    }\n    .header { margin-bottom: 30px; }\n    .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 14px; color: var(--accent-cyan); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    h2 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .code-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr; gap: 30px; flex: 1; }\n    .tree { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-muted); }\n    .tree b { color: var(--accent-cyan); font-weight: normal; }\n    .code-block { background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n    pre { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #E2E8F0; }\n    .comment { color: #64748B; }\n    .keyword { color: #F472B6; }\n    .func { color: #7DD3FC; }\n    .footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Project Organization</div>\n      <h2>Como organizar o código Android</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-grid\">\n      <div class=\"tree\">\n        src/<br>\n        ├── <b>persistence/</b><br>\n        │   ├── <b>auth/</b><br>\n        │   │   ├── AuthProvider.tsx<br>\n        │   │   └── useAuth.ts<br>\n        │   ├── <b>sync/</b><br>\n        │   │   ├── indexeddb.ts<br>\n        │   │   ├── processor.ts<br>\n        │   │   └── supabase.ts<br>\n        │   └── <b>api/</b><br>\n        │       └── client.ts<br>\n        └── <b>simulation/</b>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"code-block\">\n        <pre><span class=\"comment\">// Centralizar criação do cliente</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">export const</span> <span class=\"func\">createSupabase</span> = () => {\n  <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"func\">createClient</span>(URL, KEY, {\n    auth: { persistSession: <span class=\"keyword\">true</span> }\n  });\n};\n\n<span class=\"comment\">// Separar a lógica de persistência do UI</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">export class</span> SupabaseRepo {\n  <span class=\"keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"func\">saveSnapshot</span>(data) {\n    <span class=\"keyword\">const</span> { error } = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"keyword\">this</span>.client\n      .from(<span class=\"keyword\">'mw_snapshots'</span>)\n      .upsert(data);\n    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (error) <span class=\"keyword\">throw</span> error;\n  }\n}</pre>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <span>MWC / UMS · Supabase integration</span>\n      <span style=\"font-family: var(--font-code);\">SLIDE 06</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "seguranca_rls.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "seguranca_rls.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    :root { --bg-page:#0B1120; --bg-surface:#131B2F; --text-main:#F8FAFC; --text-muted:#94A3B8; --border-subtle:#1E293B; --accent-purple:#A855F7; --accent-cyan:#06B6D4; --accent-green:#10B981; --font-display:'Inter',sans-serif; --font-code:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; }\n    .slide-container { width:1280px; min-height:720px; background:var(--bg-page); color:var(--text-main); display:flex; flex-direction:column; padding:40px 60px; font-family:var(--font-display); }\n    .header { margin-bottom:28px; } .eyebrow { font-family:var(--font-code); font-size:14px; color:var(--accent-purple); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:8px; } h2 { font-size:36px; font-weight:700; }\n    .table-wrap { flex:1; background:var(--bg-surface); border:1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius:12px; padding:22px; }\n    table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; } th { text-align:left; font-family:var(--font-code); color:var(--text-muted); font-size:14px; padding:14px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-subtle); } td { font-size:17px; line-height:1.35; padding:17px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06); vertical-align:top; } td:first-child { width:24%; font-family:var(--font-code); color:var(--accent-purple); font-size:15px; } td:nth-child(2) { width:36%; } td:nth-child(3) { color:var(--text-muted); }\n    .code { font-family:var(--font-code); color:var(--accent-cyan); font-size:15px; } .green { color:var(--accent-green); } .footer { margin-top:auto; padding-top:20px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:14px; color:var(--text-muted); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"header\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Security Boundary</div><h2>Segurança: Auth primeiro, RLS sempre</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n      <table>\n        <thead><tr><th>Camada</th><th>Regra recomendada</th><th>Por que importa</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Chave no cliente</td><td>Somente <span class=\"code\">publishable / anon</span>; nunca <span class=\"code\">service_role</span>.</td><td>A chave pública identifica o projeto; a autorização vem da sessão e das policies.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Postgres RLS</td><td>Exigir <span class=\"code\">auth.uid()</span> e filtrar por usuário/owner nas tabelas.</td><td>Evita que um usuário leia ou escreva dados de outro, mesmo conhecendo a API.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Storage policies</td><td>Permitir <span class=\"code green\">INSERT/UPDATE</span> somente no prefixo do usuário autenticado.</td><td>O caminho do objeto vira uma fronteira de isolamento, não apenas uma convenção.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Observabilidade</td><td>Mapear erros <span class=\"code\">401 / 403 / RLS</span> para estados explícitos da UI.</td><td>“Pendente” e “confirmado” não podem ser confundidos em uma fila assíncrona.</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\"><span>MWC / UMS · Supabase integration</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-code);\">SLIDE 07</span></div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    },
