      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "plano_execucao.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }\n    :root { --bg-page:#0B1120; --bg-surface:#131B2F; --text-main:#F8FAFC; --text-muted:#94A3B8; --border-subtle:#1E293B; --accent-cyan:#06B6D4; --accent-green:#10B981; --accent-purple:#A855F7; --font-display:'Inter',sans-serif; --font-code:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; }\n    .slide-container { width:1280px; min-height:720px; background:var(--bg-page); color:var(--text-main); display:flex; flex-direction:column; padding:40px 60px; font-family:var(--font-display); }\n    .header { margin-bottom:30px; } .eyebrow { font-family:var(--font-code); font-size:14px; color:var(--accent-green); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:8px; } h2 { font-size:36px; font-weight:700; }\n    .phases { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:22px; flex:1; align-items:stretch; }\n    .phase { background:var(--bg-surface); border:1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius:12px; padding:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; border-top:3px solid var(--accent-cyan); } .phase:nth-child(2){border-top-color:var(--accent-purple)} .phase:nth-child(3){border-top-color:var(--accent-green)}\n    .phase-no { font-family:var(--font-code); color:var(--text-muted); font-size:14px; margin-bottom:14px; } .phase-title { font-size:22px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:18px; } ul { list-style:none; } li { color:var(--text-muted); font-size:16px; line-height:1.45; margin-bottom:14px; padding-left:18px; position:relative; } li::before { content:'✓'; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--accent-green); font-family:var(--font-code); } .accept { margin-top:auto; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--border-subtle); color:var(--text-main); font-size:15px; line-height:1.4; } .accept b { font-family:var(--font-code); color:var(--accent-cyan); font-size:13px; display:block; margin-bottom:6px; }\n    .footer { margin-top:auto; padding-top:24px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:14px; color:var(--text-muted); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"header\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Execution Plan</div><h2>Plano de implementação e aceite</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"phases\">\n      <div class=\"phase\"><div class=\"phase-no\">FASE 01 · IDENTIDADE</div><div class=\"phase-title\">Conectar sessão</div><ul><li>Centralizar cliente Supabase e variáveis públicas.</li><li>Implementar login, restoreSession e logout.</li><li>Amarrar configuração ao <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-code)\">user.id</span>.</li></ul><div class=\"accept\"><b>ACEITE</b>Usuário entra, recarrega a tela e continua autenticado.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"phase\"><div class=\"phase-no\">FASE 02 · DADOS</div><div class=\"phase-title\">Persistir com segurança</div><ul><li>Aplicar RLS em Postgres e Storage.</li><li>Upsert idempotente nas tabelas <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-code)\">mw_*</span>.</li><li>Upload determinístico de snapshots JSON.</li></ul><div class=\"accept\"><b>ACEITE</b>Usuário autenticado grava; usuário não autorizado recebe erro explícito.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"phase\"><div class=\"phase-no\">FASE 03 · CONFIABILIDADE</div><div class=\"phase-title\">Validar operação</div><ul><li>Testar retry, locks abandonados e falhas 401/403.</li><li>Implementar leitura paginada e recuperação após refresh.</li><li>Adicionar append transacional via Edge Function.</li></ul><div class=\"accept\"><b>ACEITE</b>Estado remoto recupera a cadeia sem duplicar eventos.</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\"><span>MWC / UMS · Supabase integration</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-code);\">SLIDE 08</span></div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
